Scenario A quoted field may contain the delimiter
Given the csv profile is : CsvProfile Vertical
| Name         | Example Bank |
| DateColumn   | Date         |
| PayeeColumn  | Description  |
| MemoColumn   | Memo         |
| AmountStyle  | Signed       |
| AmountColumn | Amount       |
Given the file contains
"""
Date,Description,Memo,Amount
01/15/2024,"SMITH, JONES & CO","Invoice 4, paid in full",-250.00
01/16/2024,"THE ""BLUE"" CAFE",,-18.50
"""
Then rows read are : CsvRowRead
| Date       | Payee              | Memo                    | Amount  |
| 2024-01-15 | SMITH, JONES & CO  | Invoice 4, paid in full | -250.00 |
| 2024-01-16 | THE "BLUE" CAFE    | none                    | -18.50  |

Scenario A quoted field may contain a line break
Description A memo typed with a newline in it arrives as one field spanning two
Description lines of the file. Counting lines by newline would split the row.
Given the csv profile is : CsvProfile Vertical
| Name         | Example Bank |
| DateColumn   | Date         |
| PayeeColumn  | Description  |
| MemoColumn   | Memo         |
| AmountStyle  | Signed       |
| AmountColumn | Amount       |
Given the file contains
"""
Date,Description,Memo,Amount
01/15/2024,HARDWARE STORE,"Paint
and brushes",-45.00
"""
Then rows read are : CsvRowRead
| Date       | Payee          | Memo             | Amount |
| 2024-01-15 | HARDWARE STORE | Paint and brushes | -45.00 |
# The break becomes a space: a memo is one line in the register.

Scenario A preamble before the header row is skipped
Description Several banks put the account number and the period above the
Description header. SkipRows says how many lines to pass over.
Given the csv profile is : CsvProfile Vertical
| Name         | Preamble Bank |
| HasHeader    | true          |
| SkipRows     | 3             |
| DateColumn   | Date          |
| PayeeColumn  | Description   |
| AmountStyle  | Signed        |
| AmountColumn | Amount        |
Given the file contains
"""
Account Statement
Account Number: ****7890
Period: 01/01/2024 to 01/31/2024
Date,Description,Amount
01/15/2024,HARRIS TEETER,-45.00
"""
Then rows read are : CsvRowRead
| Date       | Payee         | Amount |
| 2024-01-15 | HARRIS TEETER | -45.00 |

