Scenario Blank rows and a trailing total row are skipped
Description A blank line is passed over without comment. A row whose date cell
Description will not parse is reported, because it might have been a real
Description transaction rather than a footer.
Given the csv profile is : CsvProfile Vertical
| Name         | Example Bank |
| DateColumn   | Date         |
| PayeeColumn  | Description  |
| AmountStyle  | Signed       |
| AmountColumn | Amount       |
Given the file contains
"""
Date,Description,Amount
01/15/2024,HARRIS TEETER,-45.00

,Total,-45.00
"""
