Scenario A file that carries categories imports them
Description This is the migration path. An export of twenty years of history
Description names the category of each transaction, and taking it saves
Description recategorising everything by hand. A category named in the file but
Description not in the book is created, as in Accounts.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Groceries     | Expense | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
