Scenario Re-importing the same CSV file offers every row rather than skipping it
Description Nothing is created without being asked, and nothing is discarded
Description without being asked. Over twenty years both mistakes are expensive,
Description and the second is worse.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
