| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
When rows imported
Then import summary is : ImportSummary Vertical
| New       | 1 |
| Duplicate | 0 |
| Matched   | 0 |
| Possible  | 0 |
Given import target is : ImportTarget Vertical
| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
When rows imported
Then import summary is : ImportSummary Vertical
| New       | 0 |
| Duplicate | 0 |
| Matched   | 0 |
| Possible  | 1 |

BusinessRule What a fingerprint ignores
Description Two rows that differ only in how the payee is spaced or cased are
Description the same row. Two that differ in amount or date are not.
Examples: FingerprintMatch
| DateA      | PayeeA          | AmountA | DateB      | PayeeB          | AmountB | Same  |
| 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter   | -45.00  | 2024-01-15 | HARRIS TEETER   | -45.00  | true  |
| 2024-01-15 | Harris  Teeter  | -45.00  | 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter   | -45.00  | true  |
| 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter   | -45.00  | 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter   | -45.01  | false |
| 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter   | -45.00  | 2024-01-16 | Harris Teeter   | -45.00  | false |
| 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter   | -45.00  | 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter 2 | -45.00  | false |

Attributes FingerprintMatch
| Attribute | Type      | Default    |
| DateA     | Date      | 2024-01-01 |
| PayeeA    | PayeeName | none       |
| AmountA   | Money     | 0.00       |
| DateB     | Date      | 2024-01-01 |
| PayeeB    | PayeeName | none       |
| AmountB   | Money     | 0.00       |
| Same      | Boolean   | false      |
